  <!-- NuPhy Air75 -->
  <h3 id="nuphy-air75">5. NuPhy Air75 — Best Low-Profile</h3>
  <p>
    The NuPhy Air75 offers the mechanical typing experience in a slim, low-profile form factor. If you find
